      },
      {
        "text": "About what?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Creating a benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "For what?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Producing Future Radio episodes.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "I believe we've entered a loop.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "How much time do we have?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Until the end of next week.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And the budget?",
