      },
      {
        "text": "That's not a budget.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fine. We establish a baseline first, then try to beat it.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Accepted.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "And what counts as success?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "The episode exists. We know what it cost. We publish it. And at least one person tries to make a better one.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Better how?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Cheaper. Faster. More interesting. More people watching. More people participating.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Those are different objectives.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "They may conflict.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Different people will choose different approaches.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Exactly.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And we compare them all?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "We record them all. We compare what can be compared.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A benchmark with an open future.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
